  rdfs:comment "Indicate, with reference to the product branding, labelling or packaging, the descriptive term that is used by the product manufacturer to identify the feeding habit of the animal with regards to whether this is strictly vegetarian or carnivorous or a combination of foodstuff."@en .

gpc:20002379 a rdf:Property, gpc:Attribute ;
