  rdfs:comment "Includes any products that can be described/observed as a fresh wild variety of Pom Pom Blanc (cultivars), also known as Lion&apos;s Mane Mushroom, Bearded Tooth Mushroom, Monkey Head, Satyr&apos;s Beard, Bearded Hedgehog Mushroom, or Bearded Tooth Fungus, of variety Hericium erinaceus."@en .

gpc:30015530 a gpc:AttributeValue ;
