gpc:99999999 a gpc:Brick ;
  rdfs:label "Temporary Classification"@en ;
  rdfs:comment "Includes any products that can be described/observed as a product that cannot be classified within the GS1 Global Product Classification schema. This brick serves as a temporary holding place for products, which cannot be classified within the current segments of the schema due to its current evolution. The industry is encouraged to migrate as soon as the necessary classification is available. Excludes all products that can be classified within the published GS1 Global Product Classification Schema."@en ;
  rdfs:subClassOf gpc:58010100 .


